          "evidence": ["call_e1a2eb99e67347609255d15340854c1d"]
        },
        {
          "text": "A standard-library scalar check rotated order [4,1,3] over six labeled pages to [0,3,2,4,1,5]. The supplied test shapes produce block lengths from 64 to 8192 bytes, all divisible by 16, so they avoid vector-tail cases.",
